{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"The pedal-type simple type is used to distinguish types of pedal directions. The start value indicates the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"start of a damper pedal, while the sostenuto value indicates the start of a sostenuto pedal. The other values","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be used with either the damper or sostenuto pedal. The soft pedal is not included here because there is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no special symbol or graphic used for it beyond what can be specified with words and bracket elements.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpedal\/kind-swift.enum"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Kind"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The change, continue, discontinue, and resume types are used when the line attribute is yes. The change type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicates a pedal lift and retake indicated with an inverted V marking. The continue type allows more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"precise formatting across system breaks and for more complex pedaling lines. The discontinue type indicates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the end of a pedal line that does not include the explicit lift represented by the stop type. The resume"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type indicates the start of a pedal line that does not include the downstroke represented by the start"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type. It can be used when a line resumes after being discontinued, or to start a pedal line that is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"preceded by a text or symbol representation of the pedal."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/Kind-swift.enum\/change","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/Kind-swift.enum\/continue","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/Kind-swift.enum\/discontinue","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/Kind-swift.enum\/resume","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/Kind-swift.enum\/sostenuto","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/Kind-swift.enum\/start","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/Kind-swift.enum\/stop"],"title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/Kind-swift.enum\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/Kind-swift.enum","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Kind","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Kind","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLPedalV4KindO","extendedModule":"IvorMXL","symbolKind":"enum","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"MXLPedal.Kind"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://IvorMXL/s8SendableP":{"title":"